  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "It would be nice to be able to have more selective nuance in stuff, i'm sure many would like to be able to be mute except for friends they trust, without having to be constantly aware and worried they might forget their mic by accident.\n\nHaving an ability to mute voice for non friends would help a lot of people who are paranoid, or especially concerns with attempts to record or incriminate or leak conversations meant to be more private.\n\nI can understand how this might affect people who ought to be encouraged to become more socially comfortable; but i think it's best to have a choice, especially in the face of increasing abuse of screenshots and recordings.  To have the least detriment, make it a feature buried somewhere in the settings, and shows the can't hear icon for everyone that can't hear you, as well as an indicator in your quick menu like earmuffs.  Adding a Friends toggle parameter on avatars was a good step.",
